# The frozen chunk set is a shared artifact: Pelorus's pre-canned extracts and
# clusters and RAGauge's pre-canned dataset are all built against these exact
# ids and offsets. Pin it to LF so the file is byte-identical on every checkout
# and in every built artifact, rather than whatever this machine's autocrlf
# setting makes of it.
src/rag_connector/corpus/*.chunks.jsonl text eol=lf
